-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1074: a rule written as a RECORD's value leaves a HENCE on
-- its first line to the RECORD, as it did before #1074.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Seller
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF delivery

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
c MEANS
  RECORD `x` IS PARTY Seller MUST delivery HENCE FULFILLED HENCE FULFILLED
